[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6010.39, "timestamp": "01:40:10", "text": "所以他把薯片吐了我一身。哦，不。  從那天起，只要聞到任何番茄味的東西，我就吃不下。哦，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6014.31, "timestamp": "01:40:14", "text": "。  那一年我什麼番茄口味的東西都吃不下。但過了幾年後，我又開始喜歡上番茄了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6030.31, "timestamp": "01:40:30", "text": "。  它把所有番茄口味的薯片都毀了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6031.99, "timestamp": "01:40:31", "text": "我還是不能吃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6033.35, "timestamp": "01:40:33", "text": "番茄口味的薯片，因為它會讓我想起那天。我的天啊。這真的給我留下了心理創傷。  我覺得，嗯，對我來說，嗯，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6038.083, "timestamp": "01:40:38", "author": "@BRUCELEE-wt7hk", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kywKa6HSckNVxhER8qedLRRVkcGIqFFytjQHe-071HyMo=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yooo joqnix"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6041.469, "timestamp": "01:40:41", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! BRUCE LEE~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6043.135, "timestamp": "01:40:43", "author": "@BRUCELEE-wt7hk", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kywKa6HSckNVxhER8qedLRRVkcGIqFFytjQHe-071HyMo=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hello"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6050.31, "timestamp": "01:40:50", "text": "我覺得我需要習慣蜂蜜的味道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6053.55, "timestamp": "01:40:53", "text": "。  蜂蜜對我來說，我不知道為什麼，感覺有點……我不知道，就像……我……我吃它還可以，因為我現在不習慣它的味道，因為我"}]